<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0-windows</TargetFramework>
    <AssemblyName>usleep_win_cs</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Usleep.Win</RootNamespace>

    <PackageId>usleep_win_cs</PackageId>
    <Title>usleep_win_cs</Title>
    <Version>0.2.1</Version>
    <Authors>usleep_win_cs contributors</Authors>
    <Company>usleep_win_cs contributors</Company>
    <Description>High-accuracy, low-jitter microsecond sleep for Windows (WaitableTimer + QPC + Yield). .NET 10+ (Windows).</Description>
    <PackageTags>usleep;windows;timer;qpc;yield;low-jitter;realtime</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>false</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/sdkikgeneral-spec/usleep_win_cs</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/sdkikgeneral-spec/usleep_win_cs</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.2.1
- Cancellation exceptions thrown from the spin path now carry the caller's CancellationToken, so `e.CancellationToken` is consistent regardless of the requested delay.
- Fixed a handle leak and a missing wait-handle unregistration in the asynchronous WaitableTimer path.
- Fixed integer overflow in the timestamp/deadline arithmetic and added a three-stage fallback for WaitableTimer creation.
- Added `UsleepWin.MaxTailSpinMicroseconds` and enforced it as the upper bound for the tail-spin setting.</PackageReleaseNotes>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>

    <!-- ── ソースリンク ──
         .NET 8 SDK 以降 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub は SDK に組み込まれており、
         PackageReference は不要（生成済み PDB に raw.githubusercontent.com の
         マップが入ることを確認済み）。ここでは付随プロパティのみ設定する。 -->
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <!-- DeterministicSourcePaths はローカルデバッグを壊すため CI ビルドでのみ有効化する。
         ContinuousIntegrationBuild=true が DeterministicSourcePaths を引き起こす。 -->
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(ContinuousIntegrationBuild)' == '' AND '$(CI)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>

    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <SupportedOSPlatform>Windows</SupportedOSPlatform>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>preview</LangVersion>

    <DefineConstants>$(DefineConstants);USLP_WINDOWS;USLP_NUGET;USLP_GENERATOR</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(UslpX64Only)' == 'true'">
    <DefineConstants>$(DefineConstants);USLP_X64_ONLY</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Include="..\src\**\*.cs" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.ObjectPool" Version="10.*" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\LICENSE"  Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
